        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-15T20:43:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If Jackhandle replaces crowbar's added attack, then wouldn't we get a ton of all target attacks with both?</p><p>I can't imagine crowbars only reacting to the first damage dealt by a multi-damage attack, that doesn't fit anything in the wording.</p>",
