        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-15T20:48:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If Jackhandle replaces crowbar's added attack, then wouldn't we get a ton of all target attacks with both?I can't imagine crowbars only reacting to the first damage dealt by a multi-damage attack, that doesn't fit anything in the wording.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I don't know. I'm sure we'll have a lot of interesting questions to ask Christopher about Fixed Point!</p>",
